	<p>
		<hi rend="grantha">nṛpa</hi>tuṅka-vikkirama-parumaṟku yāṇṭu Iru<unclear>pa</unclear> <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/> <unclear>va</unclear>tu
	</p>
	
	<p>
		pi<unclear>ḷḷai</unclear>-p-pā<supplied reason="omitted">kka</supplied>ttu-p piḷḷai-p-pākkiḻār <gap reason="lost" quantity="5" unit="character"/> <unclear>pi</unclear>yārkku-t <hi rend="grantha">dharmma</hi>m-āka <hi rend="grantha">mahāde</hi>varkku nāṭ <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/>
		<lb n="2"/>pōṉakaṅ kāṭṭuvataṟku Ivar tampiyār Ayyakkuṭṭiyār kuṭutta nilam 
	</p>
	
	<p>	
		puṟampāṭṭilē <unclear>Ā</unclear>ṟu mā nilam Ittēvarai vaḻipaṭum tiru-p-pācūraṉukkum mutti <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/> Ip-paricu kāṭṭa-k kuṭuttēṉ
	</p>
	
	<p>	
		Ip-paricu muṭṭil UnaE taṇṭa<unclear>-p-pa</unclear> 				
		<lb n="3" break="no"/>ṭuvā<choice><orig>nṉ</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> āka<unclear>vum</unclear>
	</p>	
	
