<div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
				
	<p n="1">
		Prosperity! Fortune!
	</p>
	
	<p n="1">
		Twenty-[...]th year of Nṛpatuṅka-vikkirama-parumaṉ.<note>Sanskrit Nṛpatuṅgavikramavarman.</note>
	</p>
	
	<p n="1-2">For presenting food […] to the Mahādeva as a pious donation for (the sake of) Piḷḷaipākkiḻār [Nam?]pi of Piḷḷaippākkam, the land that Ayyakkuṭṭiyār, his younger brother gave.
		
	</p>
	
	<p n="2">I gave in this matter six <foreign>mā</foreign>s of land in Puṟampāṭu […] to the honourable Pācūraṉ who worships this god.
		
	</p>
	
	<p n="2-3">In this matter, if opposing/failing, let he be fined (an amount of) […].
		
	</p>
	
</div>      	
			
